<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Chariot cautions on Federal-Mogul buys.</title>
<headline>Chariot cautions on Federal-Mogul buys.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chariot Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it had reached agreeement with Federal-Mogul Corp to buy certain of Federal-Mogul's businesses.</p>
<p>It urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings until an announcement containing details of the acquisitions was made around May 22.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
